ATTRIBUTION

This project quotes source excerpts from TensorFold
(https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold), an LLM inference engine licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Those excerpts appear in the lesson pages under
js/lessons/ and in the verified code maps under notes/, and remain the property
of their original authors under that licence. A copy of the Apache License 2.0
is available at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

No TensorFold source is vendored in this repository; it is cloned locally by the
reader. Every excerpt is cited with its file path and line numbers so it can be
checked against the original.
